202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E ("Eagle: The Moon Lander That Was Left Behind" is a free educational coloring book that tells the story of the Apollo 11 Lunar Module "Eagle" and its science package EASEP to children aged 6 to 9. It was created for the 2026 NASA Space Apps Challenge, "Abandoned but not Forgotten: Storytelling about NASA's Discarded Equipment on the Moon and Mars".)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
