>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (All facts, dates, and numbers come from the NASA Space Science Data Coordinated Archive \(NSSDCA\), "Apollo 11 Lunar Module / EASEP": https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1969-059C \(accessed November 2026\). Our team checked every caption against this page. Conversions from kilograms to pounds were calculated by our team.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
