endobj
206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (The coloring-page drawings in this book were generated with artificial intelligence Google Gemini. Our team wrote the story and captions, chose and checked every image, redrew pages that were wrong or repeated, and laid out the book using CANVA. The drawings are simplified illustrations, not photographs, and are not drawn to scale. The astronauts are generic figures and do not show real faces.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
